<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1902595> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government what discussions they have had with Ofcom about the compliance of GB News with maintaining balance in news coverage and current affairs." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
