<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1902591> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government whether civil servants in the Cabinet Office have been allowed or instructed to continue working on the Terminally Ill Adults (End of Life) Bill when this parliamentary session ends." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
