<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1899131> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government what assessment they have made of the impact of support programmes available to small and medium-sized enterprises for AI adoption; and what steps they are taking to improve productivity, innovation and regional economic de" <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
