<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1899138> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government what discussions they have had with international counterparts regarding the enforcement of blasphemy laws in Egypt, notwithstanding constitutional protections for freedom of religion or belief; and what assessment they hav" <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
