<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1895200> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government what steps they are taking to ensure fair competition in the UK electric vehicle market and protect domestic manufacturing." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
