<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1877733> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government what assessment they have made of the ethical implications of extending the Federated Data Platform contract between NHS England and Palantir Technologies beyond its initial term; whether an independent ethical review will " <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
