<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1887133> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government what plans they have to source more oil and gas through the North Sea, given the current disruption to energy supplies caused by hostilities in the Middle East." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
