<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1887174> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government what discussions they have had with shipping companies serving Northern Ireland about higher emissions coverage on routes between Northern Ireland and Great Britain under the UK Emissions Trading Scheme (ETS) than on routes" <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
