<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1885649> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government what steps they plan to take to improve pedestrian safety on pavements and zebra crossings, and to ensure that cyclists and riders of e-bikes and e-scooters respect traffic rules." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1885649> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#answerText> "The Government recognises that it is essential that everyone using our roads is kept safe, including pedestrians. On 7 January 2026 we published our new Road Safety Strategy, setting out our vision for a safer future on our roads for all. Local authoritie..." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
