<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1883544> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government when they plan for the proposed National Police Service to be operational; and whether this is expected to be by the end of the present Parliament." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
