<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1880583> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government whether they will provide a list of commitments contained in the Safeguarding the Union command paper (CP1021), published on 31 January 2024, which have yet to be implemented in full." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
