<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1874780> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government what safeguards are in place to prevent the risk of self-diagnosed mental health conditions, such as anxiety and depression, leading to a rise in sickness benefit claims." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
