<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1876889> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government which minister will be responsible for coordinating the implementation of the child poverty strategy across government and accountable for the progress of that strategy." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
