<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1879218> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government why the Attorney General fast-tracked the prosecution of Lucy Connolly in August 2024; and what reference he made to the Code for Crown Prosecutors to support that decision." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
