<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1877759> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government what steps they are taking to prevent underage access to gambling via loot boxes, skin betting and other third party markets linked to video games." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1877759> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#answerText> "The Government is committed to ensuring games are enjoyed safely and responsibly by everyone, including children. Prizes that can be won via loot boxes do not have a monetary value, cannot be cashed-out, and are of value only within the context of the gam..." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
