<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1873080> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government what assessment they have made of the existing exemptions from the benefit cap for households with disabled children, including whether those exemptions reflect the additional costs associated with disability." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
