<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1874041> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government whether they plan to review the practice of animals not being stunned prior to slaughter; and what assessment they have made of meat produced by this method being sold to the general market and exported abroad." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
