<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1873598> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government what assessment they have made of the impact of the EU–Mercosur trade agreement on UK farmers." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
