<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1871724> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government what representations they have made to the government of India about the detention of Associate Professor Hany Babu." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1871724> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#answerText> "The UK has a broad and respectful dialogue with Indian interlocutors about human rights and rule of law. In the case of Professor Babu, it was reported in December that he has now been released from detention on bail." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
