<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1870037> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government, following the publication of the Department for Transport’s report, Road Safety Strategy on 7 January, what steps they are taking to make roads safer for pedestrians and cyclists." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
