<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1869304> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government what steps they are taking to evaluate the effectiveness of the salt reduction programme, and what plans they have for further measures to achieve that public health objective." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
