<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1866344> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government, further to the Written Answer by Lord Hanson of Flint on 4 August (HL9915), whether any Government department provides funding for training delivered by Durham Constabulary to Bahraini law-enforcement bodies; and if so, fr" <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
