<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1865054> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government what steps they are taking to prevent antisemitic hate speech at rallies and to prosecute those engaged in such speech." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
