<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1865660> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government what assessment they have made of the resilience of infrastructure and flood defences to recent and future flood events, and what plans they have to increase such resilience." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
