<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1863742> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government, with regard to the asylum policy in Restoring Order and Control, updated on 21 November, whether asylum seekers who are awaiting a decision after 12 months will be able to apply for jobs." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1863742> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#answerText> "Asylum seekers are eligible to apply for permission to work in the UK if their claim has been outstanding for 12 months or more, through no fault of their own. There are no current plans to change this policy." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
