<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1863018> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government what assessment they have made of the copyright and transparency implications of major booksellers selling fiction generated by artificial intelligence systems." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
