<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1861376> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government, following the cancellation of trains in response to an AI-generated image appearing to show damage to a bridge in Lancaster, what steps they are taking to respond to and prevent the suspension of rail services as a result " <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
