<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1861362> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government, with regard to the Public Appointments Data Report 2024/25, published on 2 December, whether they plan to set targets for the number of public appointments based on social class." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1861362> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#answerText> "The government is committed to ensuring that public appointments are more representative of our nations and regions and will set out its approach in due course. " <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
