<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1861390> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government how many Palestine Action protestors are (1) in prison, (2) in prison awaiting trial, (3) serving prison sentences, (4) on hunger strike and awaiting trial, and (5) on hunger strike and serving prison sentences." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1861390> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#answerText> "As of 12 December, 29 Palestine Action protestors are in prison; seven are on hunger strike and awaiting trial. None are serving prison sentences. Six are currently being tried and the remainder are awaiting trial." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
