<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1859568> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government whether, as part of talks seeking an end to the war in Ukraine, they plan to raise the issue of Ukrainian children living in Russian-occupied territories being detained and taken to Russia." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1859568> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#answerText> "I refer the Noble Lord to the answers I provided to the House on Ukraine: Forcible Removal of Children on 24 November. We remain, as ever, committed to supporting Ukrainian efforts to facilitate the return and reintegration of children deported by Russia." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
