<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1854866> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government what steps they are taking to develop accessibility standards for AI-enabled assistive communication technologies used by people with disabilities." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
