<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1854864> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government what assessment they have made of reports that children are using artificial intelligence chatbots for mental health advice, in particular with regard to online safety and child protection." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
