<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1855941> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government what recent diplomatic discussions they have had with the government of Tunisia about the arrest of Mustapha Djemali and Abderrazek Krimi, and what steps they are taking to ensure their release." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1855941> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#answerText> "Our Embassy in Tunis has closely followed the case of Mustapha Djemali and Abderrazek Krimi since their arrest in May 2024. We have raised the case with Tunisian authorities, including at senior levels, and participated in trial observation alongside othe..." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
