<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1855946> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government what assessment they have made of the long-term consequences of the recent storm damage in Jamaica; and what plans they have to offer long-term financial support and other contributions." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1855946> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#answerText> "I refer the Noble Lord to my statement to the House on 4 November 2025, UIN HLWS1016. The UK will continue working with Jamaica and Caribbean partners on disaster preparedness and climate resilience to deliver long-term recovery projects, including sustai..." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
