<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1854262> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government which areas of the United Kingdom have experienced the largest decreases in foreign investment since 2023; and what steps they are taking to ensure the even distribution of foreign investment throughout the UK." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
