<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1853520> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government whether negotiations on a sanitary and phytosanitary deal with the EU have begun; if not, why not; and when any such negotiations are due to begin." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
