<https://questions-statements-api.parliament.uk/api/writtenquestions/questions/1852593> <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#questionText> "To ask His Majesty's Government whether they intend to publish abortion statistics in England and Wales for (1) 2023, and (2) 2024; if so, when; and, if not, why not." <https://forgetmenot.example/accountability#graph/questions-answers> .
